// RingHoverFlight - generated task stub (no implementation here)
// Responsibilities:
// - Toggle hover mode on grip hold (right hand by default) after 'flight_unlocked' flag is true.
// - Translate input vector into horizontal movement with acceleration, speed cap, and optional vertical control (gentle auto-hover).
// - Enforce altitude cap above navmesh/ground; clamp ascent rate; prevent entering indoor/no-fly volumes.
// - Apply soft boundary forces near scene bounds (tagged volumes) and fully disable indoors or when near hard limits.
// - Drain 'ring_energy' per second while hovering; prevent engage if below min energy; auto-disengage at 0.
// - Drive speed-scaled comfort vignette; expose strength curve and min/max.
// - Show HUD flight indicators via ui_ring_hud.
// - Persist unlock state and settings across scene loads.
//
// Expected Config:
//   input: { grip_binding: 'right_grip', move_stick: 'right_thumbstick' }
//   speed_mps_max: float        // e.g., 6.0
//   accel_mps2: float           // e.g., 10.0
//   ascent_rate_mps: float      // e.g., 2.0
//   altitude_cap_m: float       // e.g., 8.0
//   energy: { resource_id: 'ring_energy', drain_per_sec: 2.0, min_to_engage: 5 }
//   comfort: { vignette_min: 0.2, vignette_max: 0.7, speed_for_max: 6.0 }
//   volumes: { allowed_tag: 'hover_allowed', no_fly_tag: 'no_fly', soft_bound_tag: 'soft_bound' }
//   unlock_flag_key: 'flight_unlocked'
//   scenes_enabled: ['oa_plaza']
//
// Integration Points:
// - Reads/writes builtin.inventory resource 'ring_energy'.
// - Respects builtin.snap_turn setting; ignores turn input while hovering if snap turn is active.
// - Reads SaveState for 'flight_unlocked' and user comfort settings.
//
// Acceptance Criteria Mapping:
// - hover_flight_unlock_and_bounds: engages only after unlock, respects caps, vignette scales with speed, disabled in hall and near boundaries.
// - performance_budget_check_pcvr: motion updates efficient; no excessive allocations; VFX minimal.
